      "text": "Its purposeful dictatorial attitude of Castro family a great dictator......Cuba should have learnt a lesson from China long back....China too a communist Country practising market economy   and one of the great super power today,,,,,,these dictators made millions to suffer for decades....what is your achieve ment i say ZERO",
